[
  {
    "start": 14.0,
    "end": 14.654,
    "text": "Welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.154,
    "end": 23.29,
    "text": "Someone just asked you for something."
  },
  {
    "start": 25.69,
    "end": 28.105,
    "text": "And the yes is already in your mouth."
  },
  {
    "start": 34.605,
    "end": 35.998,
    "text": "Before you say it,"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.398,
    "end": 42.81,
    "text": "let your eyes close, or soften your gaze toward the floor."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.31,
    "end": 50.982,
    "text": "Take a slow breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 54.582,
    "end": 56.579,
    "text": "And a long breath out."
  },
  {
    "start": 66.579,
    "end": 67.972,
    "text": "Notice the yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 70.372,
    "end": 72.625,
    "text": "The forward lean of attention."
  },
  {
    "start": 79.125,
    "end": 81.447,
    "text": "Notice where it lives in the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 91.447,
    "end": 93.165,
    "text": "Perhaps in the chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 95.565,
    "end": 97.655,
    "text": "Perhaps across the shoulders,"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.055,
    "end": 102.191,
    "text": "or in the center of the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 112.191,
    "end": 114.002,
    "text": "Let your teeth come apart."
  },
  {
    "start": 116.402,
    "end": 119.649,
    "text": "Let your tongue rest low and soft in your mouth."
  },
  {
    "start": 129.649,
    "end": 131.599,
    "text": "Now, right here, pause."
  },
  {
    "start": 138.099,
    "end": 139.316,
    "text": "Feet on the floor."
  },
  {
    "start": 141.716,
    "end": 143.016,
    "text": "Hands still."
  },
  {
    "start": 145.416,
    "end": 146.623,
    "text": "One breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 150.223,
    "end": 151.848,
    "text": "And one breath out."
  },
  {
    "start": 158.348,
    "end": 159.741,
    "text": "That's the pause."
  },
  {
    "start": 162.141,
    "end": 165.067,
    "text": "One breath between the impulse and the action."
  },
  {
    "start": 171.567,
    "end": 174.293,
    "text": "You go from reacting to observing."
  },
  {
    "start": 180.793,
    "end": 183.301,
    "text": "And in that space, you can ask yourself,"
  },
  {
    "start": 185.701,
    "end": 187.744,
    "text": "do I actually want this?"
  },
  {
    "start": 197.744,
    "end": 199.694,
    "text": "Sometimes the answer is yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 202.094,
    "end": 203.952,
    "text": "And that's completely fine."
  },
  {
    "start": 210.452,
    "end": 212.356,
    "text": "And sometimes the answer is,"
  },
  {
    "start": 214.756,
    "end": 215.685,
    "text": "Not yet."
  },
  {
    "start": 222.185,
    "end": 224.786,
    "text": "Notice the answer without judging it."
  },
  {
    "start": 234.786,
    "end": 237.247,
    "text": "Now, bring your attention inward."
  },
  {
    "start": 239.647,
    "end": 241.969,
    "text": "Feel the center of your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 244.369,
    "end": 246.784,
    "text": "Something quiet and alive."
  },
  {
    "start": 256.784,
    "end": 260.313,
    "text": "This is the part of you that exists beneath the noise."
  },
  {
    "start": 262.713,
    "end": 264.663,
    "text": "Beneath the second-guessing."
  },
  {
    "start": 271.163,
    "end": 272.696,
    "text": "That speaks clearly."
  },
  {
    "start": 275.096,
    "end": 276.907,
    "text": "That trusts itself."
  },
  {
    "start": 283.407,
    "end": 286.611,
    "text": "Offer yourself these words, gently."
  },
  {
    "start": 289.011,
    "end": 290.869,
    "text": "I am allowed to be human."
  },
  {
    "start": 297.369,
    "end": 299.366,
    "text": "I am allowed to check first."
  },
  {
    "start": 309.366,
    "end": 313.685,
    "text": "Offer yourself the same kindness you would offer a dear friend."
  },
  {
    "start": 323.685,
    "end": 325.734,
    "text": "Imagine the request again."
  },
  {
    "start": 328.134,
    "end": 329.759,
    "text": "Feel it in your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 339.759,
    "end": 340.686,
    "text": "Pause."
  },
  {
    "start": 347.186,
    "end": 348.403,
    "text": "Feet on the floor."
  },
  {
    "start": 350.803,
    "end": 351.825,
    "text": "One breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 361.825,
    "end": 363.079,
    "text": "And then choose."
  },
  {
    "start": 373.079,
    "end": 374.101,
    "text": "A breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 376.501,
    "end": 377.537,
    "text": "A question."
  },
  {
    "start": 379.937,
    "end": 381.052,
    "text": "A choice."
  },
  {
    "start": 387.552,
    "end": 389.735,
    "text": "You can return to this anytime."
  },
  {
    "start": 392.135,
    "end": 395.711,
    "text": "One breath, teeth apart, shoulders down."
  },
  {
    "start": 402.211,
    "end": 404.254,
    "text": "Take one more slow breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 407.854,
    "end": 409.061,
    "text": "And let it go."
  },
  {
    "start": 419.061,
    "end": 422.219,
    "text": "When you are ready, let your eyes open."
  },
  {
    "start": 428.719,
    "end": 430.716,
    "text": "Carry this ease with you."
  }
]
